# Copy to .env.local for `npm run dev` if you need to override the default.
# Never commit .env.local.

# Where the SPA calls the CWP API. Served behind the gateway (the container
# image and OpenShift), it is /api on the same origin -- the image builds with
# that value. For `npm run dev`, /api is proxied by vite.config.ts to the
# services running locally, so the default works as is.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
